	(text "5 V + GND + data only (12 V stays motion-only).\nID (ADC), EN, PWM + 2 spare (UART/I2C, or the Pi\nZero's USB). Tethered tools: their own supply, EN/PWM\nthrough an isolator. A toolhead MCU (K, its endstop,\nADXL345, HX711, lock sensor) is planned with it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8ab2aa3f-64f8-4764-9d14-2989794a2cd7")
	)
