		(uuid "d63e1bd2-887e-4dd1-810c-20096e13055e")
	)
	(text "- Z motor (4), K motor (4): silicone ribbons.  - A USB-C cable: the endoscope.\n- A ribbon: the Y, Z and K endstops, the MPU9250 (I2C), the BLTouch (5), 5 V / 3V3 and GND.\n- Mostly 26 AWG (~0.134 ohm/m), a short 30 AWG piece. On 5 V the drop counts twice (GND too).\n- The harness's connector pins, as the Excalidraw drawing has them: 1 3V3/5V, 4 stepper Z, 5 limit Z,\n  6 limit Y, 7 5V, 8 GND; tool side: 1 3V3/5V, 5 stepper K, 6 GND, 7 switch, 8 1-Wire. To fill in."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ee98706e-0312-47d1-b46f-28843a05e16f")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
